 "question": "How does Southwest hedge jet fuel purchases?",
 "route": "answer",
 "answer": [
  {
   "text": "Southwest terminated its remaining fuel hedge positions in the second quarter of 2025 and does not currently intend to add new fuel derivatives to its portfolio.",
   "citations": [
    "0000092380-26-000004#1A-42"
   ],
   "metrics": [],
   "signals": []
  },
  {
   "text": "The Company now purchases jet fuel at prevailing market prices, which may increase its exposure to fuel price volatility.",
